<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Enable or disable slow mode (join throttle) in the current channel. This is a shorthand for"
  )} <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/mode +j")}</code>
  or <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/mode -j")}</code>.
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it when many users or bots join in a short time, for example during a join flood. It slows down new arrivals without closing the channel."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/slow &lt;seconds&gt;
/slow 0</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>seconds</code>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "— Length of the join throttle window in seconds. Use")}
  <code>0</code>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "to disable.")}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "When enabled, new joins are throttled to prevent flooding. The mode allows a limited number of joins per time window. Use"
  )}
  <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "/slow 0")}</code> {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "to disable slow mode."
  )}
</p>

<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "The channel allows at most 5 joins in any period of the length you give. For example, %{example} allows 5 joins every 10 seconds. It sets mode %{mode}. Anyone who tries to join after the limit is reached is refused and asked to try again shortly. Bots are not limited.",
    example: "/slow 10",
    mode: "+j 5:10"
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Everyone in the channel sees a mode change line. In a registered channel, the setting is saved and stays after a restart."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Requires operator (@) or owner (~) status")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The number of seconds is required. Without it, you see the usage line."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The value must be a whole number. Text or a negative number gets the usage line."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Half-operators cannot use this command")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "You must type it in a channel window, not in a private conversation"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/slow 10
/slow 0</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-mode">{dgettext("help_commands", "/mode")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="mode-j">{dgettext("help_commands", "Mode +j (Join Throttle)")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-channel-central">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Channel Central")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
